---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About AirPDF — Privacy-First Document Utilities"
  description="Why we built AirPDF: to provide 100% free, fast, and completely private document processing directly in your browser."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">About AirPDF</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      A modern, completely free PDF tool suite designed from the ground up for maximum user privacy, air-gapped security, and zero data leakage.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">The Problem with Traditional PDF Sites</h2>
        <p>
          Most conventional PDF tools require you to upload your files to remote cloud servers. While convenient, this poses a fundamental privacy risk. Whether you're merging tax declarations, medical histories, legal contracts, or confidential business proposals, handing your documents to unknown cloud infrastructure shouldn't be necessary.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Our 100% Client-Side Solution</h2>
        <p>
          Thanks to advancements in WebAssembly and client-side JavaScript engines, modern browsers are more than capable of executing complex document manipulations locally. AirPDF leverages high-performance libraries like <code>pdf-lib</code> and <code>pdf.js</code> to process your files right on your CPU and RAM.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-sm">
          <strong>Air-Gap Capable:</strong> Once a tool page is loaded in your browser, you could literally disconnect your internet connection and the PDF manipulation will still work completely. That's why we are named <strong>AirPDF</strong>.
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">100% Ad-Free, No Paywalls, No Trackers</h2>
        <p>
          Most online PDF converters clutter your screen with intrusive banner ads, adult popups, deceptive "Download" buttons, and aggressive daily paywalls. We built AirPDF with a radically user-first philosophy: essential document productivity utilities should be fast, clean, private, and completely ad-free. No popups, no third-party ad networks, no account registrations, and no subscription walls.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
